  "open_gates": [
    "ACC PD3 open-drain one-wire firmware, readonly identity/CRC/freshness and disconnect/reconnect handling remain target uncompiled. No supported ordinary ID SKU has been qualified; parasitic write power is absent.",
    "TI specifies highimpedance IO when either supply0 and5.5Vtolerance unpowered; no numeric fulltemperature Ioff limit is provided. Leakage, partial ramps, TPS3700 power-off input injection, its450usmaximumstartup/undefinedPG interval and rail enable/disable transitions require nativeboard/physical proof. No safe health is inferred from a disconnected ID.",
    "Guaranteed .45V VILC uses exact TCA9517A and STM32G031 .4V VOL@8mA/VDD>=2.7, with10ohm total PCB/return allocation and actual low pullupcurrent. MCU aggregate80mAIO/100mAVSS absolute limits are not allowable normal targets; groundnoise, route resistance, clock/OS mode and temperature must be qualified; do not substitute a .4V-contention repeater or extra hostseries resistor.",
    "The existing field terminal is bounded ordinary0..5.5V only. TPD10Vmaxclamp@1A and330ohm do not qualify arbitrary24V miswire, boardESD or allsurge. Fastclamp overshoot, faultenergy and return/chassis geometry require tests.",
